        "query": "WITH b AS (\n  INSERT INTO bookings (lead_id, rep_name, starts_at, calendar_event)\n  VALUES ($1::uuid, 'Sales Team', $2::timestamptz, $3)\n  RETURNING id\n), e AS (\n  INSERT INTO lead_events (lead_id, event_type, payload)\n  VALUES ($1::uuid, 'booked', jsonb_build_object('starts_at', $2::text))\n  RETURNING id\n)\nUPDATE leads\nSET status = 'booked', updated_at = now()\nWHERE id = $1::uuid\nRETURNING id;",
